3|1@Diablo^1440807160#cuj8yrp:cdiddy11$:People ask this question all of the time, and the first responses are always stupid shit like "there's only one build for the meta lol". The truth is, if you want to push 60+, sure, the likelihood that more than 1 build per character is viable that high is pretty low. However, if you want to get to 40+, or just want to play on your own, or dont care about top 1000, as long as you are a few grifts from the bottom and having a great time, there are A LOT of viable builds available to you. Nearly every class set for every class is good enough to get to 40, and with the cube, there are a ton of options to play. tl;dr - Unless top 250 leaderboards are your thing, you can find several fun builds for each class. Figure out what your goals are, and find a build that's fun and meets those goals.
